==============================
     FILE CREATION
==============================

cat > file          Create file with content
touch file          Create empty file
touch file{1..4}    Create multiple files
touch .file         Create hidden file

==============================
     OPEN EDITOR
==============================

vi file             Open VI editor
vim file            Open VIM editor
nano file           Open Nano editor

==============================
     INSERT MODE
==============================

i                   Insert before cursor
I                   Insert beginning of line
a                   Insert after cursor
A                   Insert end of line
o                   New line below
O                   New line above
Esc                 Command mode

==============================
     MOVEMENT
==============================

h                   Left
j                   Down
k                   Up
l                   Right
gg                  Beginning of file
G                   End of file
:25                 Go to line 25

==============================
     COPY / PASTE
==============================

yy                  Copy line
3yy                 Copy 3 lines
p                   Paste below
P                   Paste above

==============================
     DELETE
==============================

dd                  Delete line
3dd                 Delete 3 lines
:5d                 Delete line 5
:$d                 Delete last line
:3,6d               Delete lines 3 to 6

==============================
     SEARCH
==============================

/word               Search forward
?word               Search backward
n                   Next result
N                   Previous result

==============================
     UNDO / REDO
==============================

u                   Undo
Ctrl+r              Redo

==============================
     SAVE / QUIT
==============================

:w                  Save
:q                  Quit
:q!                 Force quit
:wq                 Save and quit
:x                  Save and quit
ZZ                  Save and quit

==============================
     LINE NUMBERS
==============================

:set nu             Show line numbers
:set nonu           Hide line numbers

==============================
     FIND & REPLACE
==============================

:%s/old/new/g       Replace all words

==============================
     VIM ENCRYPTION
==============================

:X                  Encrypt file
